{"job_id":"F-886b2a0082218290a73a","family_id":"F-886b2a0082218290a73a","title":"일본 및 중국산 탄소강 및 그 밖의 합금강 열간압연 제품에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":52,"target_id":"eb1d9df533b676d7ed30dbda385fb600c97d8b66a84e563b95be3f35123f4b23","source_hash":"45b1d39053b786f9e36fb6c23456de6c7246233fb048a867f47671b1a1464909","text":"关于对日本和中国热轧碳钢及其他合金钢产品征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"544ae66bae192a7fa5ca2b74f5e85fab5189edeb4d2d416e2ec7231bf6652ef6","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":951,"target_id":"f8db465c52f4ccd2db6a3ffeb045b0cbc8dd8ca018cf2c32b063c31a5421f93e","source_hash":"f20b3f5a3389d97b11d0759dfda97fb6b0074f2ec6fd9252a685d0d2384cf76c","text":"第二条（征税对象） 征收反倾销税的商品为产自日本和中国的热轧碳钢及其他合金钢（根据《海关法》实施令第98条第1款、第7208.37.1000号、第7208.36.1000号等，海关和统计协调制度项下编码为7208.10.1000、7208.10.9000、7208.25.1000、7208.25.9000、7208.26.1000、7208.26.9000、7208.27.1000、7208.27.9000、7208.36.1000、7208.36.9000的商品编码，以及《海关法》实施令第98条第1款、第7208.37.1000号、第7208.36.1000号等，适用《海关法》实施令第98条第1款、第7208.37.1000号、第7208.36.9000号等）。 7208.37.9000、7208.38.1000、7208.38.9000、7208.39.1000、7208.39.9000、7208.40.0000、7208.53.1000、7208.53.9000、7208.54.1000、7208.54.9000、7208.90.0000、7211.13.0000、7211.14.1000、7211.14.9000、7211.19.1000，在与税号对应的项目中编号为 7211.19.9000、7225.30.1000、7225.30.9010、7225.30.9091、7225.30.9092、7225.30.9099、7225.40.1000、7225.40.9092、7226.20.0000、7226.91.1000、7226.91.2000 或 7226.91.9000 的货物，应视为符合下列各款的所有要求。但是，附件 1 中列明的货物除外。\n1. 经加热轧制的铁、碳钢或其他合金钢等\n2. 它应呈卷材、片材或板材等形式。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":951,"end":1178,"target_id":"a32254eaf9c36162462d0dde05cb85e8f7068c03508e5c44ca9a95cde1b51c63","source_hash":"3286280cc1f80a99255caf6df9e77cd31b14d2c8e7ba35fbf5e1b9cab375b04a","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商）\n① 受反倾销税约束的供应商，是指根据第2条规定受反倾销税约束的货物的供应商。\n② 尽管有第1款的规定，附件2中列明的供应商，如已根据《海关法》第54条第1款的规定接受财政经济大臣作出的价格调整承诺，则不属于第1款规定的反倾销税货物供应商之列。但是，如果该价格调整承诺未得到履行，则应当征收反倾销税。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1178,"end":1266,"target_id":"79f52f682b314e3842869abfabda406e21cf3061e95f44fd9c8d3cf79b18b0cd","source_hash":"258cb84107757a89e4c56317a84843e0fc80341d91ff280ab4073961bc0aa5a1","text":"第四条（反倾销税税率）根据第三条第一款和第二款但书征收反倾销税的，被征收货物的供应商的反倾销税税率应按附表3规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1266,"end":3016,"target_id":"bd45e63fadcb745b58ba9bc72048f6c5f405c60dbb9f7761f98ed61cf9bec25d","source_hash":"93b04bb709166ccd5dd0b31cbc805871ff44a90d1583251225838324a82002e5","text":"补充规定 <2026年6月23日第35号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n不征收反倾销税的商品（与第2条各款以外的但书有关）\n■ 对日本和中国热轧碳钢及其他合金钢产品的反倾销措施      \n\n  征收关税的规则[附件1]                                                \n\n  不征收反倾销税的商品（与第2条各款以外的但书有关）      \n\n  1. 符合下列各项要求的铁、非合金钢及其他合金钢的扁轧产品     \n\n  枪                                             \n\n    A. 厚度应为 4.75 毫米 (mm) 或以上                                       \n\n    B. 宽度应为 600 毫米或以上                                              \n\n    c. 它不会是线圈形状                                                     \n\n    D. 不要冷轧                                                 \n\n  2. 热轧产品包覆（包覆：两种或多种金属在高温高压下粘合）    \n\n  粘合）、电镀或涂层产品                             \n\n  3. 合金钢产品满足下列各项的所有要求                                  \n\n    a. 碳含量应为总重量的 1.2% 或更低。                           \n\n    B. 铬含量应为总重量的10.5%或以上                        \n\n  4. 用于金属、木材和塑料加工的模具和切削工具等      \n\n  和以下任意项目                                       \n\n    A. 作为日本大同特殊钢（大同钢铁株式会社）的产品，布氏硬度（HB）      \n\n  W) NAK80、NAK55、DC11、               \n\n  DC53, DH2F, DCMX, DH31-EX, DHA-WORLD, DH31-S, PXA30, PAC                      \n\n  5000、NAK86K、DHA1、PD613、DH32、DHA-GIGA、RDH494 钢材牌号                        \n\n    B. 作为日本Proterial有限公司的产品，布氏硬度(HBW)为277     \n\n  HPM1、HPM31、SLD、SLD-f、洛氏硬度 (HRC) 为 41 或更低的 SLD 或更低的               \n\n  10, SLD-MAGIC, HAP10, HAP40, HAP5R, YXM1, YXM4, YXR7, YXR                     \n\n  3，YXR33 钢级                                                                 \n\n    c. 作为中国浙江晶瑞模具有限公司的产品    \n\n"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00001","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889898","source_hash":"c5601e1f50ccf18f36253fdda1d7b2f64ea5800ddd942146dda77568674b1c2f","text":"■ 对来自日本和中国的热轧碳钢及其他合金钢产品进行反倾销"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00002","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889899","source_hash":"c2a5912269afdb2e8e14c0f8a05f82dbeccfc06f2218bc4093d55e2f036b162b","text":"征收关税的规则[附表1]"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00003","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889900","source_hash":"08033728e1e82bb64069d3c640d647763fdbed7901a205add09ea295ffde8783","text":"免征反倾销税的货物（与第2条但书相关，但不包括其子款）"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00004","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889901","source_hash":"3dd3dba545d9921eb32068848289a7070a3e08788082d2d1682d4db4b61828ab","text":"1. 符合下列各项要求的铁、非合金钢及其他合金钢的扁轧产品"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00005","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889902","source_hash":"7c7221327981881d6092ff8785d8b46f988392f4d70acdfdf4e2bc7c060d6123","text":"和"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00006","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889903","source_hash":"d4913f00810e088ae288fff57363629fb707251c0da43d968ca276d78699d167","text":"a. 厚度应为 4.75 毫米 (mm) 或以上"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00007","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889904","source_hash":"b4e95742ab6be5b3432f6e2b66556c9aa3352c7d68316e70e9cc089e0ee7e820","text":"a. 宽度应为600毫米或以上"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00008","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889905","source_hash":"eaba41689bcd360c05b0840922504466d1fd8eec218851ca4fb6ba7b9b5b7c33","text":"。它不是线圈形状的"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00009","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889906","source_hash":"bb495c3afbe907fb8f5e0f105a45b2f2b7bc5a57e5de8e51eb63cc92d9f15d00","text":"d. 不要冷轧"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00010","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889907","source_hash":"d37172fa3fc4f7664f47162fd3c41162fcdb0ea5d2fd87b7970b759a50e791d4","text":"2. 复合（复合：两种或多种金属在高温高压下粘合）热轧产品"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00011","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889908","source_hash":"d3c406082b4f89a51e043e3a231a76efa3641466c7a31ee6eb9acde435d95540","text":"粘合）、电镀或涂层产品"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00012","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889909","source_hash":"75b19fc57327e812da3a47b96ac52a13d0ba8c53d0b6921d8d1f0ec1c28701d0","text":"3. 合金钢产品满足以下各项的所有要求"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00013","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889910","source_hash":"eab92e0abbf38baa3e806b49f98732d5b730476e19a686de039f131a7f29dc2d","text":"a. 碳含量应为总重量的1.2%或更低"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00014","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889911","source_hash":"b7f05d68c02d1c204bce82ef76b6e0c1cd8d889e8119533f26a231b7c3d9858a","text":"a. 铬含量应占总重量的10.5%或以上"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00015","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889912","source_hash":"7c9b85bb0b6f8ff1c4c9f6cecc0fa035db46bcf83ffd413b8e0aca8567023cb9","text":"4. 用于金属、木材和塑料加工的模具和切削工具等。"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00016","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889913","source_hash":"923dae661a497adcb2c4db68529b68a7fde632e9c8677b553a6dd0ad86bd3414","text":"和以下任意项目"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00017","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889914","source_hash":"d395226f02cd6750dbb705b3b048a2cf8208b213d6ad991a92b433f61c1f57ec","text":"a. 作为日本大同特殊钢（大同钢铁株式会社）的产品，布氏硬度（HB"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00018","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889915","source_hash":"48f00c39c2437753822bf3110492cea28d589e6da4600d23093ab80e256dcba8","text":"W) 255 或更低，或洛氏硬度 (HRC) 43 或更低，"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00019","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889916","source_hash":"1aaf16c2c61a7ba53d4b7d54246d9db224445253438d3a4f128c23175eee8293","text":"DC53, DH2F, DCMX, DH31-EX, DHA-WORLD, DH31-S, PXA30, PAC"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00020","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889917","source_hash":"2eec20299fa8cf7499dd2c0ea6ce714b36a6c86eff3dcb73716ce4ef01b4b70f","text":"5000、NAK86K、DHA1、PD613、DH32、DHA-GIGA、RDH494 钢种"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00021","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889918","source_hash":"f6e4eb6313203ac923df7616b397052163f894a8f89f1a15a077e4904a7ebc7c","text":"b. 作为日本Proterial公司（Proterial, Ltd.）的产品，布氏硬度（HBW）为277"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00022","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-015162-287461-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2889919","source_hash":"e29c8e50d28c94423e0cbc30c4a00f56c82043a00cf2af61ab192c7cbd81a595","text":"或 HPM1、HPM31、SLD、SLD-f、SLD"},{"id":"A39978-zh-00023","doc":"A39978","law_id":"kr-01